9ltn|n|A sensation of dryness in the throat associated with a craving for liquids, produced by deprivation of drink, or by some other cause (as fear, excitement, etc.) which arrests the secretion of the pharyngeal mucous membrane; hence, the condition producing this sensation. ; Fig.: A want and eager desire after anything; a craving or longing; -- usually with for, of, or after; as, the thirst for gold. ; To feel thirst; to experience a painful or uneasy sensation of the throat or fauces, as for want of drink. ; To have a vehement desire.	a:a3ky,137,11;4iq2,134,15;4di4,125,4;7mzv,109,8;a3ur,89,5;4jz4,72,8;8xpz,72,17;30eo,69,13;32dj,66,11;2cxd,61,3;34q3,47,8;95fj,23,5;47fs,20,4;7468,19,5;47cb,17,3~8xpz,72,17;4iq2,134,15;30eo,69,13;32dj,66,11;a3ky,137,11;3ugs,13,8;34q3,47,8;4jz4,72,8;7mzv,109,8;7rjb,6,7;1so2,11,5;a3ur,89,5;95fj,23,5;7468,19,5;4di4,125,4	v:7mzz,124,2;7n00,114,6;1xtq,57,1;4f20,44,7;8a43,34,3;37j5,21,2;1bt2,16,3;7tog,10,1;8a41,9,1~4f20,44,7;7n00,114,6;8a43,34,3;1bt2,16,3;7mzz,124,2;37j5,21,2;1xtq,57,1;7tog,10,1;8a41,9,1	V:7mzx,113,6;7n00,98,2;4f20,26,2~7mzx,113,6;4f20,26,2;7n00,98,2	n:7mzv,79,1;47mr,53,1;zre,49,8;30eo,32,1;8a41,29,4;34q3,27,2;2csc,22,1;340q,12,2;7t8z,12,4;7b8f,6,6;p99,1,3~zre,49,8;7b8f,6,6;7t8z,12,4;8a41,29,4;p99,1,3;34q3,27,2;340q,12,2;30eo,32,1;47mr,53,1;7mzv,79,1;2csc,22,1	N:7mzy,147,5;3u0k,57,4;8gz7,54,1;30dq,19,6;5ol1,8,1~30dq,19,6;7mzy,147,5;3u0k,57,4;8gz7,54,1;5ol1,8,1
